  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 만에 맞이하는 개교기념일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">작년과 재작년은 토</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일요일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">ㅠ</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">인 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아름다운 이천중학교에 다녀왔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 9</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">40</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분, 학교에 도착하여 오후 늦은 시간까지 소중한 배움의 시간을 가졌습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">남학생 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">23</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여학생 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명의 생기발랄한 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학년들은 입장하시는 김정식 선생님을 열렬히 환호하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시작단계에서 아이들이 와글거려도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">집중하지 않아도 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">조용히 해라</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">책을 펴라 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">등의 지시어는 한 번도 듣지 못하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">화면에서 흘러나오는 암석송을 따라 부르면서 자연스레 집중 모드로 변하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수업 방법은 특별하지 않은 듯 특별하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">컴퓨터와 연결된 대형 화면과 분필을 이용한 판서를 병행하였고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">초등학생용 변성암 표본을 나누어주었으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">크기가 작아서 관찰에 용이하면서 주요 변성암 모두 포함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">최첨단기기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(S</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사의 갤</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모델</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">로 보낸 모둠별 관찰 결과 기록이 대형 화면에 등장하는 등 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">45</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분이 어떻게 흘러갔는지 모를 정도로 몰입이 되더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수업이 시작되고 한참동안 교과서를 펼치지 않던 아이가 나중에 스스로 책을 열고 모둠 활동에 참여하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 잠시 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">책상 위에 엎드리는 아이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">암석 표본에 있는 &#49073;&#49073;이를 톡톡 터트리는 아이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">엉뚱한 대답을 하는 아이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">… </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">누구에게도 질책이나 지적을 하지 않았는데도 학생들은 메인 수업 분위기에 동화되어 갔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">김정식 선생님의 수업을 참관하면서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2001</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 이스라엘에서 창의성중심의 과학교육 연수를 받을 때 방문했던 중등학교의 과학 수업이 연상되었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 때의 수업 분위기와 비슷하였거든요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님의 수업참관을 통해 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">34</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 동안 고집스럽게 유지해왔던 제 수업 스타일을 돌아보게 되었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">복도</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">급식실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">심지어 화장실에서 만난 선생님들도 미소 지으며 인사해주셔서 감사했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저도 이제부터는 학교에서 낯선 사람을 만나면</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">따뜻한 눈길을 담아 인사하리라 다짐했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">다양한 수업 아이디어를 배우고 과학교사로서 살아가는 이야기를 나누는</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">소중한 만남의 시간을 허락해주신 김정식 선생님께 지면을 빌려 감사드립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">덧붙여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주신 선물</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사진</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도 수업에 잘 활용할게요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.     </span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C7284D5CAC18E506\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190408_211015.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_99C7284D5CAC18E5064977\"/></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}